  "created": "2021-10-23T22:09:53.216Z",
  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "Sharp lines making a region of focus (unblurred section of image) appear on an occluding out of focus player avatar marking the silhouette of an in focus but occluded player avatar\n\nIn the attached image you can clearly see the fingers of an occluded hand showing as a \"shadow\" of focus on the occluding player.\n\nThe blur filter also wrongly does not extend to the image edge",
